  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "'## [11.0.0-prerelease.1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.6.0-prerelease.1...v11.0.0-prerelease.1) (2026-05-15)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **kubernetes-client:** The `LabelSelectors` namespace is renamed to `Selectors`.\nTo migrate, rename the namespaces.\n* **kubernetes-client:** The `DefaultEntityLabelSelector` class is now sealed instead\nof public. To mitigate, use the implementation with the interface\n(intended way) instead of subclassing the default selector.\n\n### Features\n\n* **kubernetes-client:** add field selector support ([#1094](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1094)) ([c16228f](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/c16228faf7a20485d8d672fdff1de7c3a613684b))\n'",
